"His friend Angie is erased before his eyes on integration day."
"Pax, his momentary mentor, plants a tiny tracking shard in his thumb during orientation."
"Pax steers him toward the Epic class Shadow Knight before Taltos seizes his orientation."
"He survives a hell-difficulty solo tutorial on a burning isle as the only human among beasts."
"He gains a Wand of Force at orientation and the broken sword Blightbane in a sewer dungeon."
"The Crimson Blight's controlling core infects him in that dungeon and hides inside his body."
"He befriends Bandit and the lemur tribe and gives them spears, cooking and the idea of speech."
"He fights in the arena bonus round, kills a Fallen rhino and earns the enhanced Survivor trait."
"After the arena he trades the Basic class Survivor for the Uncommon class Kineticist."
"He crosses Blackmist Bog and climbs the Tower of Rizzen by way of its secret basement."
"He trains a month under the blademaster Rita and joins the School of the Ever-Surging Blade."
"He takes five Species-Experience Pills from the evaluation course and evolves to grade D early."
"He is the second human to reach grade D, after the centennial Ella."
"He defeats the blight's core in a contest of wills and gains the bloodline trait Blightborn."
"He takes the Rare class Force Weaver and joins the roof battle late."
"Earth's own planetary magic flows into him for the blow that drives the Guardian off the roof."
"Back on Earth he starts in the Bladewind Badlands and takes the Trailblazer Profession."
"He helps kill the Armada Wurm and is voted leader of Aurora, Earth's first capital."
"Citizens call him Nick the Silver after the silver pure-mana flame on his sword."
"He founds the Promethean Coalition and earns the title First Among Equals."
"Kerry publishes his survival guide, whose first line reads: not all treasure comes in chests."
"He restores Blightbane on a leyline and becomes the first human to own a Legendary item."
"He crosses the Labyrinth with Kenji, Bandit and the lurk to clear the dreadbeast quarantine zone."
"He forms the Concept of the Devouring Blade and ascends to Tier 2 while fighting Xuthu."
"He devours the cores of three dreadbeast monarchs and gains the bloodline trait Dreadeater."
"He is the first human to reach grade C, and he chooses Meta as humanity's next attribute."
"He is the first human to cap every attribute at grade D."
"At level 50 he takes the Unique Legendary class Ascendants' Hope."
"Part of his DNA now belongs to the Crimson Blight, and its progenitor calls him its child."
"The Blight names him Child of the Blight, Scion of the System and Nemesis of the Hollow God."
"He alone recalls his trials of mastery in full, perhaps through his gift for portal visions."
"He shares a psychic bond with Liz and can feel her sensations as she feels his."
"Silver bands ring the top of each iris from attuning his core to force and pure mana."
"His Concept later deepens into the All-Devouring Blade."
"Corrupted entities instinctively hunt him before other prey because of his class."
"For a time he holds the highest combined attributes of anyone on Earth."
